 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 10 – 12, use the scatter plot below.</p>\n<p>This scatter plot shows foal birth weight and mare’s weight.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS MARE WEIGHT IN KILOGRAMS ON THE X-AXIS AND FOAL WEIGHT IN KILOGRAMS ON THE Y-AXIS.\" class=\"atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"311\" src=\"exercises/media/549da7e49a755131.jpg\" width=\"450\"></p>\n <br>",
